    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Say goodbye to blurry and pixelated images! SuperImage uses cutting-edge AI technology to upscale and restore the details of your favourite pictures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2728 Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude80 Unlimited Image Enhancements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance and upscale images without worrying about credits and subscriptions. Sky is the limit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcbb On Device Processing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take advantage of modern computer hardware combined with our advanced AI stack to process your images locally, without sharing them with an online service. No internet connection required</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc65 Enhance Your Portraits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen details, refine facial features, and enhance background clarity of your low-resolution portraits. Your friends never looked this good before</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\uddbc Images Sharper Than Ever</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upscale your photos, wallpapers and anime waifus up to 16x their original resolution. Blurry pictures are a thing of the past</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Load Custom Models</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For advanced users who want a experience more tailored to their needs, you can import your favourite models in PyTorch, ONNX and MNN formats with just one click</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd12 Your Privacy, Our Priority</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SuperImage processes your photos locally on your device, never uploading them to the cloud</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Say goodbye to blurry and pixelated images! SuperImage uses cutting-edge AI technology to upscale and restore the details of your favourite pictures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2728 Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude80 Unlimited Image Enhancements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance and upscale images without worrying about credits and subscriptions. Sky is the limit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcbb On Device Processing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take advantage of modern computer hardware combined with our advanced AI stack to process your images locally, without sharing them with an online service. No internet connection required</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc65 Enhance Your Portraits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen details, refine facial features, and enhance background clarity of your low-resolution portraits. Your friends never looked this good before</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\uddbc Images Sharper Than Ever</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upscale your photos, wallpapers and anime waifus up to 16x their original resolution. Blurry pictures are a thing of the past</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Load Custom Models</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For advanced users who want a experience more tailored to their needs, you can import your favourite models in PyTorch, ONNX and MNN formats with just one click</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd12 Your Privacy, Our Priority</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SuperImage processes your photos locally on your device, never uploading them to the cloud</p>",
